@* A small round signal beside a line of text: the sync note, the conflict panel, the
   legend's "new volume". Decorative — the words next to it carry the meaning. Publication
   status has its own mark (StatusDot) and is not this. *@

<span class="signal signal--@(Tone.ToString().ToLowerInvariant()) @(Large ? "signal--large" : null)" aria-hidden="true"></span>
